        "runId": "ada-en-0c9cd3aa-38d8-4e78-85c2-7fba7217988e",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Arrive in Lima, where you’ll be met at the airport and taken to your hotel to check in and rest.\n\nPeru’s capital stretches along the Pacific coast. The Spanish founded the city, and today European architecture stands alongside pre-Inca sites. On your first walks through Lima, you can already see traces of different eras side by side."
    },
